From ArmadaOS adtbloader (https://github.com/armada-os/adtbloader), BSD-3-Clause.

1. Copy this folder from the SD card to Android internal storage.

2. In RPSettings, use "run script as root" to run describe_android_dt.sh.

3. Copy identity.txt, android.dtb, and active-dtbo.img from the adtbloader
   folder in Android internal storage to your PC.

4. Attach all three files when requesting ArmadaOS device support.
